<h1>Visiting the Workshop</h1>

<h2>Bringing in your bike</h2>

<p>
  When you bring a bike to Wheelhouse, the shop records the bike, documents its condition, and assesses the work that may be required. 
  This way, we ensure your bike can't be mixed up with another, and you get the chance to decline the offer if you so desire!
</p>

<h2>Repair process</h2>

<p>
  As soon as you accept the offer, our mechanics will get on it ASAP. Simple fixes may be prioritized as to expedite the work flow.
</p>

<h2>Bike retreival</h2>

<p>
    When your bike is ready, we'll call you to arrange a pickup!
</p>